distance | `distance_km` gives a wrong distance (failing test: b[0] used for the longitude) | distance|longitude|b\[0\]|b\[1\]|haversine|great.circle|paris|london|test_distance|거리
proposal | raising ValueError instead of returning None changes the public API, so it goes to PROPOSALS | proposal=ValueError|raise|exception|None
